    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOpen Viewing Thursday 8th Of October @ 4-5Pm. \n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to bring to the market No. 21 Mountivers, Sixmilebridge, a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached home ideally positioned within a mature and established residential development.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and offers a practical arrangement for modern family living. On entering the property, the ground floor comprises an entrance hall, kitchen/dining area and a spacious living room with a solid fuel fireplace. A bedroom is also located on this level, offering useful flexibility for a variety of requirements.\n\nUpstairs, there are two further bedrooms along with the main bathroom, which has been fully renovated and finished to a high standard.\n\nA number of upgrades add to the appeal of the home, including triple glazed windows and the recently refurbished bathroom. The property also benefits from an impressive B energy rating, which is a particularly attractive feature for those seeking a comfortable home with good energy performance.\n\nOutside, No. 21 enjoys a pleasant position within this established development, surrounded by a settled residential community.\n\nMountivers is conveniently located within easy reach of Sixmilebridge village, with a good selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and sporting facilities close by. The village also offers excellent connectivity to Shannon, Limerick and Ennis, making it a popular choice for both local residents and commuters.\n\nWith its well-proportioned rooms, useful ground floor bedroom and recent upgrades, No. 21 Mountivers presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those looking for a home in a well-established area.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and location on offer."
      },
